WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.703
-During a radio interview
last night,

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:06.305
former Chicago Bears coach
Mike Ditka

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:08.274
weighed in on the recent
national anthem protest.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:09.342
Ditka said...

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.690
Here to comment is one of
our writers, Amber Ruffin.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.658
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.093
-Thanks, Seth!

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:31.431
Now, former Chicago Bears' coach
Mike Ditka said,

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.199
"There hasn't been
any oppression

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.934
in the last 100 years."

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:38.638
Which officially makes him
daa-worst!

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:40.039
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:43.142
70% of NFL players are black.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:46.312
How can you work with so many
black people and not know them?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.914
Seth knows me.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.582
Seth, what do I do
with my free time?

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:52.986
-You watch "Scandal"
and pretend you're Olivia Pope.

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:56.522
-Yep.
And what is my favorite food?

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.524
-Your favorite food
is margaritas.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:00:59.826
[ Laughter ]
-Correct.

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.829
And what is it like to be
a black person in America?

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.264
-That is not something
I as a white person

00:01:05.264 --> 00:01:07.500
am qualified to talk about.
But...

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.405
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.708
...from what I can glean,
not great?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.877
-That is the correct answer.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:21.547
And if you think things are
going great for black people,

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:25.151
you're on daa-wrong side
of history!

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.288
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:31.624
Mike Ditka, what do you know
about oppression?

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.760
You won one Super Bowl in 1986,

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.430
and they gave you
your own steakhouse!

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.834
Charles Barkley was one of
the greatest basketball players

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:43.603
of all time
and all he got was fat.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.338
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.741
You think no bad things
have happened to black people

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.843
for 100 years?

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.746
Charlottesville happened
this summer!

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:57.083
And then, again, three days ago!

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.551
Ditka also said,

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:00.887
"If you want to kneel
during the national anthem,

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.989
you should go to another country
and play football."

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.125
What other country?

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:08.060
We're the only ones dumb enough

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.063
to spend our Sundays
wearing tights

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:12.031
and giving each other
brain damage.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.800
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:18.404
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.608
Look, Jerry Jones threatened to
bench players

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.876
who protest the national anthem.

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:27.079
That is a white man
threatening his black players

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:31.050
with punishment if they exercise
their right to free speech.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.921
Which can be found
in daa-Constitution.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:39.291
[ Cheers and applause ]
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.460
Daa-Constitution.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.795
Daa-Constitu--

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.097
I think it's not
all the way there.

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:46.966
Daa-Constitution!

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.600
Is it right?

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.536
-It's daa-fine.

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:54.507
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.809
-In summary, Mike Ditka believes

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.979
that all players should stand
for the national anthem.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:01.547
And I'm sure they will.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:04.850
As soon as the anthem
stands for all players.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.453
Daa-end!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:07.453 --> 00:03:09.288
-Daa-end!

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:11.891
Amber Ruffin, everybody!

